{"id":"d0dc2670ffdd2806","group":"91","path":"91/91-fact-theory-comparison.md","title":"fact-theory-comparison — 标准真理理论的多维比较","display":"fact-theory-comparison — 标准真理理论的多维比较","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-fact-theory-comparison","aliases":["91-fact-theory-comparison"],"display":"fact-theory-comparison — 标准真理理论的多维比较","depends_on":["[[91-df-TB]]","[[91-df-UTB]]","[[91-df-CT]]","[[91-df-FS]]","[[91-df-KF]]","[[91-df-VF]]","[[91-df-truth-strength]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-fact-theory-comparison"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-fact-theory-comparison</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-theory-comparison — 标准真理理论的多维比较"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6018cc1b13710826\" href=\"?note=6018cc1b13710826\" title=\"91-df-TB\">91-df-TB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2f215d3f10d33ae6\" href=\"?note=2f215d3f10d33ae6\" title=\"91-df-UTB\">91-df-UTB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4e1e503ea918b41a\" href=\"?note=4e1e503ea918b41a\" title=\"91-df-CT\">91-df-CT</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25c37fe51095276d\" href=\"?note=25c37fe51095276d\" title=\"91-df-FS\">91-df-FS</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"669ee474b9646a38\" href=\"?note=669ee474b9646a38\" title=\"91-df-VF\">91-df-VF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c87db4d1858a0009\" href=\"?note=c87db4d1858a0009\" title=\"91-df-truth-strength\">91-df-truth-strength</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal T)\\)</span> (理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> 的算术后果)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{CT}^{-},\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{CT}^{-},\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (保守理论与基础算术)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{VF}\">\\(\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{VF}\\)</span> (自指真理理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega},\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0},\\mathrm{ID}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega},\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0},\\mathrm{ID}_1\\)</span> (比较用理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathcal A\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (共同的算术后果类)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\equiv_{\\mathcal A}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\equiv_{\\mathcal A}\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\prec_{\\mathcal A}\">\\(&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\prec_{\\mathcal A}\\)</span>\n(算术后果等强与严格包含)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}theory\\text{-}comparison}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{TB})\n=\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{UTB})\n=\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{CT}^{-})\n=\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{PA})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}theory\\text{-}comparison}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{TB})\n=\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{UTB})\n=\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{CT}^{-})\n=\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{PA})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以及</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\n&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\n\\mathrm{KF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\n&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\n\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{ID}_1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FS}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\n&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\n\\mathrm{KF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\n&lt;_{\\mathrm{arith}}\n\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{ID}_1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>理论</th>\n<th>核心机制</th>\n<th>算术强度或保守性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>TB</td>\n<td>闭句去引号</td>\n<td>对 PA 保守</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UTB</td>\n<td>基础公式的一致去引号</td>\n<td>对 PA 保守</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span></td>\n<td>组合公理、无含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的全归纳</td>\n<td>对 PA 保守</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FS</td>\n<td>组合公理与 capture/release 规则</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；标准 FS 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-不一致的</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KF</td>\n<td>强 Kleene 组合公理与全 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span>-归纳</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VF</td>\n<td>超赋值公理</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ID}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{ID}_1\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>这些比较必须固定理论版本和后果语言。语义上使用三值或超赋值模型，\n不等于其外层证明逻辑就是三值逻辑；标准 KF、VF 与 FS 通常都以经典\n一阶逻辑公理化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-TB","status":"resolved","id":"6018cc1b13710826","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-TB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-UTB","status":"resolved","id":"2f215d3f10d33ae6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-UTB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-CT","status":"resolved","id":"4e1e503ea918b41a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-CT]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-FS","status":"resolved","id":"25c37fe51095276d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-FS]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-KF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-VF","status":"resolved","id":"669ee474b9646a38","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-VF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-strength","status":"resolved","id":"c87db4d1858a0009","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-strength]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{CT}^{-},\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{VF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\omega},\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\varepsilon_0},\\mathrm{ID}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\equiv_{\\mathcal A}","display":false},{"tex":"<_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\coloneqq\\prec_{\\mathcal A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}theory\\text{-}comparison}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{TB})\n=\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{UTB})\n=\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{CT}^{-})\n=\n\\operatorname{Th}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FS}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\omega}\n<_{\\mathrm{arith}}\n\\mathrm{KF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\varepsilon_0}\n<_{\\mathrm{arith}}\n\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\mathrm{ID}_1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RT}_{<\\varepsilon_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ID}_1","display":false}],"bytes":2206,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["6018cc1b13710826","2f215d3f10d33ae6","4e1e503ea918b41a","25c37fe51095276d","a0a2284f96eaea1d","669ee474b9646a38","c87db4d1858a0009"]}